  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat. Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the fries between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d06d9b6ea5936499250afb-4e8dc101.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While fries are baking, grate zucchini and carrot, squeezing out any excess moisture with a paper towel.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Thinly slice spring onion.\n• Thinly slice tomato. TIP: Removing excess liquid from the veggies will help the fritters crisp up in the pan!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d06d9b6ea5936499250afb-594c355a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine zucchini, carrot, spring onion, garlic, the milk, the egg, Parmesan cheese, All-American spice blend, a pinch of chilli flakes (if using), the plain flour, the salt and a pinch of pepper. TIP: Lift out some of the mixture with a spoon, if it's too wet and doesn't hold its shape, add a little more flour!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d06d9b6ea5936499250afb-a769a748.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When fries have 10 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• When oil is hot, add heaped tablespoons of the fritter mixture in batches and flatten with a spatula. Cook until golden, 3-4 minutes each side (don't flip too early, allow time for the fritters to set!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. You should get 3-4 fritters per person. TIP: Add extra olive oil between batches as needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d06d9b6ea5936499250afb-b9358910.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While fritters are cooking, halve bake-at-home burger buns and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d06d9b6ea5936499250afb-cef5107c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread burger buns with a layer of smokey aioli.\n• Top each bun base with two cheesy veggie fritters, a handful of mixed salad leaves and tomato slices.\n• Serve with sweet potato fries and any remaining fritters and smokey aioli. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d06d9b6ea5936499250afb-652f9e18.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
